      "id": "java-8-datetime-api",
      "heading": "Java 8 Date/Time API",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "java.time Package"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Introduced to solve the limitations of Date and Calendar.",
            "Immutable, thread-safe, and intuitive.",
            "Organized under java.time package.",
            "Includes utility methods for common operations like: plus(), minus(), format(), parse(), etc."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "wordCount": 31,
      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "core-classes-in-javatime",
          "heading": "Core Classes in java.time",
          "level": 3,
